	measure '% Another' = ```
			
			    CALCULATE(
			        DISTINCTCOUNT( FactKaimahi[person_id] ),
			        FactKaimahi[Gender] = "Other"
			            || FactKaimahi[Gender] = "Non-binary"
			    )
			        / CALCULATE(
			            DISTINCTCOUNT(FactKaimahi[person_id] )
			        ) + 0
			
			```
		displayFolder: Gender Ratios
		lineageTag: 913bd868-cfce-4a10-a840-2fbc3f007395

		changedProperty = FormatString

		annotation PBI_FormatHint = {"isGeneralNumber":true}

	measure '% Female' =
			
			CALCULATE(
			    DISTINCTCOUNT( FactKaimahi[person_id] ),
			    FactKaimahi[Gender] = "Female"
			)
			    / CALCULATE(
			        DISTINCTCOUNT( FactKaimahi[person_id] )
